{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09840","headline":"武威春暮闻宇文判官西使还已到晋昌 · 岑参","name":"武威春暮闻宇文判官西使还已到晋昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸雨过城头，黄鹂上戍楼。\n塞北飘客泪，边柳挂乡愁。\n白发悲明镜，青春换敝裘。\n君从万里使，闻已到瓜州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}